OL,3,GNEWSAJason Arday research cleared
OL,4,Afollowing Queen's University
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FResearch by academic Jason Arday, who
OL,8,Fwas accused of plagiarism before his
OL,9,Fdeath, has been cleared by one of the
OL,10,Finstitutions that was investigating
OL,11,Fhim.
OL,13,FQueen's University Belfast (QUB) began
OL,14,Flooking into Jason Arday's work after
OL,15,Fhe resigned from his University of
OL,16,FCambridge roles.
OL,18,FThe university had published a paper on
OL,19,Fits academic research site co-authored
OL,20,Fby Arday and other academics from
OL,21,FQueen's in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
